  "description": "FAZA 16 — Search Rate Management: the per-user pacing layer in front of the FAZA 15 search flow queue (modules/search/rate.js). Rate limit (one admitted search per user every perUserMs), post-result cooldown, anti-spam ENTER flood protection and global burst detection. The layer decides WHO may search HOW OFTEN — admitted searches stay 100% real (byte-identical FTS); every rejection is an explicit 429 with retryInMs. Console: #/admin/search-rate · Config: POST /api/search/rate/settings.",
